{{!-- The foot of an essay: a line about the author (the author's bio from their Ghost profile), the way to get the next essay by email, and the way to answer. post.hbs leaves this out of notes, Now months, things and garden notes. The reply link uses the support email address in Ghost's Settings, Membership, and stays hidden while that is still "noreply". Context: the post. --}}
<aside class="essay-end" aria-label="{{t "About the author"}}">
    {{#primary_author}}{{#if bio}}<p class="essay-end-bio">{{bio}} <a href="{{@site.url}}/about/">{{t "More about me"}}</a></p>{{/if}}{{/primary_author}}
    <p class="essay-end-links">
        {{#if @site.members_enabled}}{{#unless @member}}<span>{{t "New essays by email, when there is one."}} <a href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup">{{t "Subscribe"}}</a></span>{{/unless}}{{/if}}
        {{#match @site.members_support_address "!=" "noreply"}}<span>{{t "Disagree, or know better?"}} <a href="mailto:{{@site.members_support_address}}?subject=Re%3A%20{{encode title}}">{{t "Reply by email"}}</a></span>{{/match}}
    </p>
</aside>
